Principle Where How Single responsibility <code>TransactionBatalSerializer</code>, the <code>batalkan</code> action, <code>TransactionService.batalkan_setoran</code> The serializer validates the alasan, the view speaks HTTP (200, or 409 for <code>SaldoTidakCukup</code> and <code>SetoranDibatalkan</code>), and the service owns the rule, the locks and the saldo. On mobile, <code>BatalkanSetoranDialog</code> collects the alasan and shows errors, and <code>TransaksiNotifier</code> calls the use case. Open/closed <code>TransaksiQuerySet</code>, <code>AktivitasFilterBar(tipeTersedia:)</code> New behaviour arrives as additions: a queryset method the reports read through, and a parameter the filter bar is configured with. Reopening Pencairan edits a constant, not the widget. Liskov substitution <code>TransaksiQuerySet</code> It's a <code>QuerySet[Transaksi]</code>, so every function still typed against the base (the exporter's sheet builders, <code>apply_period</code>) takes it unchanged, while the reporting entry points call <code>.tercatat()</code> on it. Interface segregation <code>TransactionBatalSerializer</code>; the nasabah DTO A client voiding a setoran sends one field and doesn't go through the edit serializer. The nasabah history DTO gains only <code>status</code>, not who voided it or why. Dependency inversion <code>TransaksiNotifier</code> → <code>BatalkanTransaksiUseCase</code> → <code>TransaksiRepository</code> The notifier depends on the use case, and the use case on the repository interface, all injected by <code>injectable</code>. Tests swap the network for a <code>StubApi</code>. lib/features/transaksi/domain/use_cases/batalkan_transaksi_usecase.dart<pre><code>@lazySingleton
class BatalkanTransaksiUseCase
    implements UseCase&lt;TransaksiDetailEntity, TransaksiBatalRequest&gt; {
  final TransaksiRepository repository;

  BatalkanTransaksiUseCase(this.repository);

  @override
  Future&lt;Either&lt;NetworkException, TransaksiDetailEntity&gt;&gt; execute(
      [TransaksiBatalRequest? args]) {
    return repository.batalkanTransaksi(args!);
  }
}
</code></pre>

