</code></pre> <p>The list only navigates and refreshes; the form owns the application. The detail page's appeal already works this way, so there is one convention for "a page I opened changed something".</p>

lib/features/onboarding/presentation/pages/register_nasabah_screen.dart<pre><code>/// Where [RegisterNasabahScreen] was opened from.
